Description: Acetate 4k Intro/2004/Linux
 4k intro by Acetate, released in 2004 for the #demoscene 4k source
 compo, where it ranked 2nd ex aequo with 39 points.
 .
 Software rendered effects in a 256x256 SDL window: noise, rotating
 squares, wobbling raster bars, zooming bitmap texts and greetings, in
 less than 4 KB of C source. Press any key to quit.
